block newscontent
  p.card-text
  p One paper was accepted for publication at the International Conference on Information Visualization Theory and Applications (SciTePress IVAPP 2021, part of VISIGRAPP 2021).
  ul
    li Daniel Atzberger, Tim Cech, Merlin de la Haye, Maximilian Söchting, Willy Scheibel, Daniel Limberger, and Jürgen Döllner: "Software Forest: A Visualization of Semantic Similarities in Source Code using a Tree Metaphor"
  p
    | The conference is held as a virtual conference from February 8th until February 10th. More information at 
    a(href="http://www.ivapp.visigrapp.org/" target="_blank") www.ivapp.visigrapp.org/
    | .
